 "puzzle", "game"], "long_description": "A classic game makes its way to VR, bringing with it a level of challenge and immersion that only VR can provide. You are placed inside a sphere of letters and must find the words hidden within. Choose from categories with vibrant themes, each featuring several puzzles to keep you entertained. Go ahead, jump into a whole new universe of word games with Word Search VR.", "short_description": "A classic game makes its way to VR, bringing with it a level of challenge and immersion that only VR can provide. You are placed inside a sphere of letters and must find the words hidden within. Choose from categories with vibrant themes, each featuring several puzzles to keep you entertained. Go ahead, jump into a whole new universe of word games with Word Search VR."}]}, "developer_name": "Shaking Earth Digital, LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1103DTNm0GUk0HvWRR5wpcrFbmLfN9I97hQLLnnLhneU/pub", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jjZYgYbbpV0gqMp1O3ki-XpGUo-Uvj3AWYrd3lNlMEw/pub", "publisher_name": "Shaking Earth Digital, LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.facebook.com/WordSearchVR/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD", "GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "3201398096852195"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75340705_2741424372754794_878615491885662